  "representation": "symbolic",
  "expression": "r = qT/Q; A0(qqbar) = r^2/(1 + r^2), A0(qg) = 5 r^2/(1 + 5 r^2); A0(f) = f A0(qg) + (1 - f) A0(qqbar); A2 = A0 (phi1 = 0 at O(alpha_s)); lambda = (2 - 3 A0)/(2 + A0); nu = 2 A2/(2 + A0); 1 - lambda - 2 nu = 4 (A0 - A2)/(2 + A0) = 0. Per channel: lambda = (2 - r^2)/(2 + 3 r^2), nu = 2 r^2/(2 + 3 r^2) (q qbar); lambda = (2 - 5 r^2)/(2 + 15 r^2), nu = 10 r^2/(2 + 15 r^2) (q g)",
